        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Oh",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "Ladies and gentlemen (Yeah)",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "The moment you've all been waiting for",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "In this corner, weighing one hundred and seventy-five pounds",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "With a record of seventeen rapes, four hundred assaults, and four murders",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "The undisputed, most diabolical villain in the world",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "Slim Shady (Let's go)",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_1",
      "type": "chorus",
      "performer": "Eminem",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "So crack a bottle, let your body waddle",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "Don't act like a snobby model, you just hit the lotto",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "Uh-oh, uh-oh, bitches hoppin' in my Tahoe",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "Got one ridin' shotgun, and no, not one of 'em got clothes",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "Now, where's the rubbers? Who's got the rubbers?",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "I noticed there's so many of 'em and there's really not that many of us",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "And ladies love us, my posse's kickin' up dust",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "It's on 'til the break of dawn and we're starting this party from dusk",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_2",
      "type": "interlude",
      "performer": "Eminem, 50 Cent",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Okay",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "Let's go",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "(Shady, haha)",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_3",
      "type": "verse",
      "performer": "Eminem",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Back with Andre the Giant, Mr. Elephant Tusk",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "Fix your musk, you'll be just another one bit the dust",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "Just one of my mother's sons who got thrown under the bus",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "Kiss my butt, lick fromunda cheese from under my nuts",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "It disgusts me to see the game the way that it looks",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "It's a must, I redeem my name and haters get mushed",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "Bitches lust, man, they love me when I lay in the cut",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "Fisticuffs, the lady give her eighty-some paper cuts",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "Now picture us, it's ridiculous, you curse at the thought",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "'Cause when I spit the verse, the shit gets worse than Worcestershire sauce",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "10",
          "text": "If I could fit the words, it's picture perfect, works every time",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "11",
          "text": "Every verse, every line, as simple as nursery rhymes",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "12",
          "text": "It's elementary, the elephants have entered the room",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "13",
          "text": "I venture to say we're the center of attention, it's true",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "14",
          "text": "Not to mention back with a vengeance, so hence the signal",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "15",
          "text": "Of the bat symbol, the platinum trio's back on you, hoes",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        }
      ]
    },
