    {
      "section_id": "section_6",
      "type": "verse",
      "performer": "Dr. Dre",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "They see that low rider go by, they're like, \"Oh my\" (Woo)",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "You ain't got to tell me why you're sick 'cause I know why",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "I dip through in that Six-Trey like, \"Sick 'em, Dre!\"",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "I'm an itch that they can't scratch, they're sick of me",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "But hey, what else can I say? I love LA",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "'Cause over and above all, it's just another day",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "And this one begins where the last one ends",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "Pick up where we left off and get smashed again",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "I'll be damned, just fucked around and crashed my Benz",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "Drivin' 'round with a smashed front end, let's cash that one in",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "10",
          "text": "Grab another one from out the stable",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "11",
          "text": "The Monte Carlo, El Camino, or the El Dorado?",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "12",
          "text": "The hell if I know, do I want leather seats or vinyl?",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "13",
          "text": "Decisions, decisions, garage looks like Precision Collision",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "14",
          "text": "Or Maaco, beats quake like Waco",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        },
        {
          "n": "15",
          "text": "Just keep the bass low, speakers away from your face though",
          "persona_id": "slim_shady"
        }
